# Purpose: make a cross-lane edit VISIBLE in the pull request rather than
# silent. Last matching pattern wins, so order matters here.
#
# GitHub resolves these to real accounts, not agent names. Replace the
# placeholders below with the GitHub handles that drive each agent. Until
# then, every path falls back to the repository owner.
#
#   @ossykelvin  - repository owner / human gate
